{
  "uid": "homelab-security",
  "title": "Security",
  "description": "The labels config.alloy extracts from pfSense filterlog and Suricata: interface, action and direction; classification and priority. Five Loki rules fire on them and this is where they are drawn. Addresses stay in the log line and are parsed at query time, per ADR-0003.",
